ple:\r\n\r\n- Create a Shape resource in the FileSystem that is not allowed by SpringArm3D.\r\n- Create a SpringArm3D node and select it.\r\n- Drag that Shape onto the shape property of the SpringArm3D.\r\n- You will see that it accepts the Shape instead of rejecting it.\r\n\r\nYou can see this behavior of rejecting resource drag & drop in Decals, Light3D projector, PointLight2D, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501098124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501200918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117409#issuecomment-5501200918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117409","id":5501200918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR-WqFg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T22:20:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:20:00Z","body":"> You can see this behavior of rejecting resource drag & drop in Decals, Light3D projector, PointLight2D, etc.\r\n\r\nStrange, I don't know why this is happening then. The property declarations look identical, and setters seem to be largely the same (with the exception of Decal printing a warning on incompatible types, but this does not change control flow).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501200918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]